Hello,

The following Design Registration has not been updated for 5 months.  

Registration Number: {!Core_Design_Registration__c.Name}
Design Registration Name: {!Core_Design_Registration__c.Core_Design_Registration_Nm__c}
End Customer Name: {!Core_Design_Registration__c.Core_End_Customer_Nm__c}

If no updates are made to the Design Registration in the next 30 days, it's status will be set to Abandoned (and no action is necessary). If you would like the status to be changed, please update the Design Registration by logging into your Salesforce account.

Thank you. 



